---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE, url } from '../lib/posts';
---

<Base title="About" section="about">
  <header class="page-header">
    <h1>About</h1>
  </header>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I'm <strong>FireSkull</strong> (<code>alwil17</code> on GitHub). I play capture-the-flag competitions and publish
      structured writeups here.
    </p>
    <p>
      Every writeup follows the same path: reconnaissance, analysis, exploitation, flag, remediation. The goal is not
      only to show the flag but to make each solve reproducible, and to explain the root cause and how a defender would
      fix it.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Scope:</strong> web, crypto, pwn, reverse, forensics, stego, OSINT, cloud, boot2root, KOTH.</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Language:</strong> posts stay in the language I solved them in, French or English, and never mix the
        two.
      </li>
      <li><strong>Format:</strong> see the <a href={url('/posts/writeup-style-guide/')}>writeup style guide</a>.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2 id="elsewhere">Elsewhere</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Portfolio: <a href={SITE.portfolio}>{SITE.portfolio.replace('https://', '')}</a></li>
      <li>GitHub: <a href={SITE.github}>{SITE.github.replace('https://', '')}</a></li>
    </ul>
    <div class="callout callout-note">
      <p class="callout-title">Note</p>
      <p>
        Flags shown here are truncated and come only from challenges that are over. Nothing on this site discloses live infrastructure,
        credentials or private competition data.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
